# Copy to .env in this directory (gitignored). Never commit real values.
#
# Workshop OpenShift clusters are ephemeral and different every install.
# Log in with `oc login` first. ./install.sh refuses to run if `oc whoami` fails.
# Do not put API URLs, tokens, kubeconfigs, or CA certificates in git.
#
# Granite 3.2 8B Instruct is pulled as a ModelCar OCI image. No Hugging Face token.

# Optional: path to a local kubeconfig produced by `oc login`
# KUBECONFIG=

# Optional: AWS instance type when the installer clones a GPU MachineSet (NVIDIA L4)
# QUESTSHIFT_GPU_INSTANCE_TYPE=g6.4xlarge
